      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## DMARC sender investigation\n\nStart with **Critical: DMARC failure sources**. SPF or DKIM being **not aligned** does not by itself mean that DMARC failed: DMARC passes when at least one mechanism is authenticated and aligned. The two alignment tables therefore include the final DMARC outcome. Identify a sending system by the combination of **source IP**, **PTR hostname**, **Header From**, and the SPF/DKIM identity; PTR alone is not a trusted identity. Use the **Source IP** filter or click an IP to narrow all tables.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
